      "en": "If you want FastAPI on Lambda specifically: **mangum** wraps the app as a handler. Fine for small APIs; for big apps, WebSockets or long tasks a container service is easier. Either way: state lives in a database or cache, never in instance memory (it can vanish at any time)."
