      "en": "**object storage** (**s3**, GCS, R2): files (invoices, images, reports) under keys, cheap and practically unlimited. Do not store files in the database or on the container’s disk (it disappears). The database holds the path and metadata, the file lives in the bucket — and the bucket is always private."
